                    13. Secret; Nodis.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d124-f2" n="2" xml:id="d124-f2-content">
                <p> Kissinger spoke with Ford about his upcoming meeting with Suharto.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
